{"overview":"پس از وقایع شورش، جهان به نظر می‌رسد در تعادل باشد—اما آن صلح شکننده است. با ظهور تهدیدی جدید مرتبط با والبورگیسناخت، هومورا آکمی مجبور می‌شود پیامدهای انتخاب‌هایش را روبه‌رو شود و سؤال کند تا چه حد حاضر است برای محافظت از مادوکای برود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"After the events of Rebellion, the world appears to be in balance—but that peace is fragile. As a new threat connected to Walpurgisnacht emerges, Homura Akemi is forced to face the consequences of her choices and question how far she is willing to go to protect Madoka.","tagline_en":"The world will not exonerate her.","runtime":120,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["宮本幸裕","新房昭之"],"crew_en":["Yukihiro Miyamoto","Akiyuki Shinbo"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"悠木碧","role":"Madoka Kaname (voice)","photo":"/a5Mkd66GV1l3c9bZZtnvjUf33T2.jpg","en":"Aoi Yuuki"},{"name":"斎藤千和","role":"Homura Akemi (voice)","photo":"/jxWuA4K0ZPkOQMeIgLlzaHSkgiV.jpg","en":"Chiwa Saito"},{"name":"喜多村英梨","role":"Sayaka Miki (voice)","photo":"/oZuKOoiqUsZZcgO5wqlUoZQUPfw.jpg","en":"Eri Kitamura"},{"name":"آی نوناکا","role":"Kyoko Sakura (voice)","photo":"/gEZVaoDeVK04HCmv0dJr6MGO9Se.jpg","en":"Ai Nonaka"},{"name":"کائوری میزوهاشی","role":"Mami Tomoe (voice)","photo":"/eDhVZ9en7T4lvsQ99OkRizroSQd.jpg","en":"Kaori Mizuhashi"},{"name":"阿澄佳奈","role":"Nagisa Momoe (voice)","photo":"/5GroiCPTO6PcYaZQXTGWltoT1kq.jpg","en":"Kana Asumi"},{"name":"加藤英美里","role":"Kyubey (voice)","photo":"/m0zqjeg65sEe5TTy4mKqgwXVipI.jpg","en":"Emiri Kato"},{"name":"若山詩音","role":"Shichōka (voice)","photo":"/b697ggFreuliEfl4TjLgxhJCQXr.jpg","en":"Shion Wakayama"},{"name":"黒沢ともよ","role":"Selma Therese (voice)","photo":"/eSRnva88YVcUXlDHdVrhier2SGU.jpg","en":"Tomoyo Kurosawa"},{"name":"新谷良子","role":"Hitomi Shizuki (voice)","photo":"/jKdvT4CEWgP0YfREgZI960vsC1A.jpg","en":"Ryoko Shintani"},{"name":"坂本真綾","role":"Wasu (voice)","photo":"/jcjTJbxN3rYOtjSJihvbygvEFFZ.jpg","en":"Maaya Sakamoto"},{"name":"青山吉能","role":"Girl A (voice)"